{"type": "NarrativeText", "element_id": "d151adf8ffdf242a585c488070a95c94", "text": "I found the unit code and unit name i needed to search, but it was too hard to remember, so i selected it, crtl-c and crtl-v it into the search of the new map screens. It pasted the selection but no search results would appear. i had to delete the pasted text and then type in words for it to work.", "metadata": {"languages": ["eng"], "filename": "18389.txt", "filetype": "text/plain", "parent_id": "19a46e27afc63ff21a822c43c752eab2", "data_source": {"url": null, "version": null, "record_locator": {"id": "18389", "key": "MAP-535", "board_id": null, "project_id": "MAP"}, "date_created": "2025-03-10T02:01:39.100+0000", "date_modified": "2025-04-04T05:52:43.330+0000", "date_processed": "1744461415.3359292", "permissions_data": null, "filesize_bytes": 946}}}